OL,3,GNEWSAThieves who filmed boasts about
OL,4,Acrimes jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a "highly organised" rural
OL,7,Fcrime gang who filmed videos of
OL,8,Fthemselves laughing and boasting about
OL,9,Ftheir crimes have been jailed.
OL,11,FThe five men, Zamuel Mallinson,
OL,12,FBenjamin Barnes, Richard Rowles, Jordan
OL,13,FHoward, and Ryan Mumby, from across
OL,14,Facross Lincolnshire, were linked to 13
OL,15,Fburglaries and three thefts, with
OL,16,Flosses valued by officers at almost
OL,17,F#800,000.
OL,19,FThese included the theft of three quad
OL,20,Fbikes belonging to the Royal National
OL,21,FLifeboat Institution (RNLI).
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
